          "start": 136
        },
        "quote": "(a) No person shall refuse to pay the legal fare for a taxicab after having hired such taxicab, and no person shall hire a taxicab with intent of defrauding the person from whom it is hired.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.65.030:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
